'' std/containers, a real module since 2026-10-10 (it was a facade over containers.bi): an
'' Array filled, Sort'ed and passed to a containers.Array( of long ) parameter; Map, Set, the
'' generic Contains and HashOf -- and, under 'using', a Map keyed by a user type that hashes
'' itself through containers.Hashable, the hook that replaced re-opening namespace FB.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/modules/src/stdfacade/containers.bas -o tests/modules/stdcontainers.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/stdcontainers.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 1 2 3 6
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 1 7 true true -1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 1 one-two
